.TH CWE-918 7 "2026-11-15" "CWE Top 25 (2025)" "Software Weakness Reference"
.SH NAME
CWE\-918 \- Server\-Side Request Forgery (SSRF)
.SH RANK
2025 CWE Top 25 rank: \fB#22\fR (2024 rank: 19).
.SH CLASSIFICATION
Class: Web / Injection.
.SH DESCRIPTION
The server fetches a URL supplied or influenced by the user without validating the destination, so an attacker coerces requests to internal services, link\-local cloud metadata endpoints, or arbitrary hosts \- bypassing network controls and exposing internal data.
.SH MITIGATION
Allow\-list permitted hosts/schemes; resolve the hostname and reject private, loopback and link\-local ranges; disable redirects to disallowed targets; and isolate outbound requests from internal/metadata services.
